      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-11-02_WidnesExaminer_art0064" n="art0064">
        <head>ALWI JA:S INIC. DOUG AINS PATENT SELF-RAISING FLOUR, THZ 13SEST. THE EXAMINER SATURI)A Y, NOVEBMER 2, 1895. RUNCORN SCIENCE AND ART CLASSES. c</head>
